 of the equation $e^{4+4y}=25.$\n\n$y=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139538286 17592186045443 true] [17592186655624 1072 #uuid "0d5857fb-0238-5a41-804e-93aaf70c5113" 13194139538286 17592186045443 true] [17592186655624 1074 "First, we find the natural logarithm $(\\ln)$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}e^{4+4y}&=25 \\\\ \\ln(e^{4+4y})&=\\ln(25)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use the fact that $\\ln(e^u)=u$ to simplify the left-hand side. This gives\n\n$$\n4+4y=\\ln(25).\n$$\n\nFinally, we solve for $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4+4y&=\\ln(25) \\\\ 4y&=\\ln(25)-4 \\\\ y&=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\ln(25)-4\\right) \\\\ y&=-1+\\frac{1}{4}\\ln(25)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $y=-1+\\frac{1}{4}\\ln(25).$" 13194139538286 17592186045443 true] [17592186655625 1068 #edb/ref 17592186655631 13194139538286 17592186045443 true] [17592186655625 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139538286 17592186045443 true] [17592186655625 1071 "Find the **exact** solution of the equation $e^{3+2y}=10.$\n\n$y=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139538286 17592186045443 true] [17592186655625 1072 #uuid "116eef0d-fc21-56c3-88da-a38fa1536d37" 13194139538286 17592186045443 true] [17592186655625 1074 "First, we find the natural logarithm $(\\ln)$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}e^{3+2y}&=10 \\\\ \\ln(e^{3+2y})&=\\ln(10)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we use the fact that $\\ln(e^u)=u$ to simplify the left-hand side. This gives\n\n$$\n3+2y=\\ln(10).\n$$\n\nFinally, we solve for $y,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3+2y&=\\ln(10) \\\\ 2y&=\\ln(10)-3 \\\\ y&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\ln(10)-3\\right) \\\\ y&=-\\frac{3}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(10)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $y=-\\frac{3}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(10).$" 13194139538286 17592186045443 true] [17592186655626 1075 #edb/ref 17592186655633 13194139538286 17592186045443 true] [17592186655626 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139538286 17592186045443 true] [17592186655626 1077 "field-1" 13194139538286 1